Epoch_2a_childDeposit
├── given the active strategy is remote on Child
├── and Parent and Child use distinct chain selectors
├── and Parent and Child have crosschain vault allowlists configured
├── and the epoch has net deposits
├── when CRE closes the epoch through Parent WorkflowRouter
├── then ParentVault should mark the epoch claimable before remote settlement
├── and ParentVault should open the next epoch
├── and ParentVault should bridge net USDC to the child strategy chain
└── and the depositor should claim Yieldcoin shares on Parent
